-2. **Mask Coordinates:** Apply the depth mask to both `origin` and `destination` coordinates. For each component $c \in \{x, y, z\}$, compute:
-   $$ \text{masked}_c = \lfloor c / \text{child\_bit\_depth}[depth] \rfloor $$
